OL,3,GNEWSAMurdered dog walker in 'wrong     
OL,4,Aplace, at wrong time'                  
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Phil Walker said: "We      
OL,7,Fbelieve he's been the victim of quite a
OL,8,Fsustained violent assault, and we're   
OL,9,Freally keen to identify who was        
OL,10,Fresponsible and bring them to justice."
